li><li>Weight: 30 kB.<br></li><li>Height: 28 px.<br></li><li>Width: 15 px.<br></li><li>Outline: 2 px.<br></li><li>Eyes: Black.<br></li><li>Hair: Balding, has some gray patches on the back of his head.<br></li><li>Unique signs: Smells like a combination of dirty socks and expired meat.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/925520/extras/3cc42e8a3a1ae69709360959086416a8.avif?t=1536747444\" /></div><br><i>-Some recent photos of Bedford.</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/925520/extras/e7e5e34873184362357a643ff876f6d3.webp?t=1536747444\" /></div><br><br>If you manage to find him or have gathered any valuable information, please let us know in the comment section below.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/925520/extras/e7e5e34873184362357a643ff876f6d3.webp?t=1536747444\" /></div><br><br>THANK YOU FOR YOUR HELP!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/925520/extras/e7e5e34873184362357a643ff876f6d3.webp?t=1536747444\" /></div>",
